        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=10$.",
          "worked": "At the intersection, the $y$-values are equal.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_3(x-1)&=2\\\\x-1&=3^2\\\\x-1&=9\\\\x&=10\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince $10>1$, $x=10$ is valid.",
